Attorney...  <BR>North Carolina:  Tobacco Is A Vegetable <BR>North Dakota:  We Really Are One Of The 50 States! <BR>Ohio:  At Least We're Not Michigan <BR>Oklahoma:  Like The Play, Only No Singing <BR>Oregon:  Spotted Owl ... It's What's For Dinner <BR>Pennsylvania:  Cook With Coal<BR>Rhode Island:  We're Not REALLY An Island <BR>South Carolina:  Remember The Civil War?  We Didn't Actually Surrender <BR>South Dakota:  Closer Than North Dakota Tennessee:  The Educashun State <BR>Texas:  Si' Hablo Ing'les (Yes, I Speak English) <BR>Utah:  Our Jesus Is Better Than Your Jesus Vermont:  Yep <BR>Virginia:  Who Says Government Stiffs And Slackjaw Yokels Don't Mix? <BR>Washington:  Help! We're Overrun By Nerds And Slackers! <BR>Washington, D.C.:  Wanna Be Mayor? <BR>West Virginia:  One Big Happy Family ... Really! <BR>Wisconsin:  Come Cut The Cheese <BR>Wyoming:  Where Men Are Men ... and the sheep are scared !!!||||reg||1
